{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be welcome to the puppet show ! Today, The Furballer will amuse you with a unique performance: football puppet destruction. </strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730090/extras/55aecb3fb3b3dc580a89c3905ed46ab3.avif?t=1711662168\" width=600 height=124 /></span><br><br>Furballer is an arcade game where you take on the role of a puppet football player: The Furballer. Navigate the stage, kicking the ball into the enemy puppets to rack up points and secure the best show. The public will rate your performance live so be sharp, don't miss and keep on kicking ass... or heads !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730090/extras/36ede9b74ab93d94260ad257482ff709.poster.avif?t=1711662168\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730090/extras/36ede9b74ab93d94260ad257482ff709.webm?t=1711662168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730090/extras/36ede9b74ab93d94260ad257482ff709.mp4?t=1711662168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2730090?t=1711662168","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2730090?t=1711662168","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1711662168","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1711662168","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be welcome to the puppet sh